modelica://Modelica.Magnetic/RotorDispla:
Modelica.Magnetic: RotorDisplacementAngle (model)

Calculates rotor lagging angle by measuring the stator phase voltages, transforming them to the corresponding space phasor in stator-fixed coordinate system, rotating the space phasor to the rotor-fixed coordinate system and calculating the angle of this space phasor.  
 The sensor's housing can be implicitly fixed ( useSupport=false ). If the machine's stator also implicitly fixed ( useSupport=false ), the angle at the flange is equal to the angle of the machine's rotor against the stator. Otherwise, the sensor's support has to be connected to the machine's support.

Code:
model RotorDisplacementAngle "Rotor lagging angle"
  parameter Integer m = 3 "Number of phases" ;
  parameter Integer p(min = 1) "Number of pole pairs";
  parameter Boolean positiveRange = false "Use only positive output range, if true";
  parameter Boolean useSupport = false "Use support or fixed housing" ;
  Modelica.Blocks.Interfaces.RealOutput rotorDisplacementAngle(final quantity = "Angle", final unit = "rad") ;
  Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Interfaces.PositivePlug plug_p(final m = m) ;
  Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Interfaces.NegativePlug plug_n(final m = m) ;
  Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.Flange_a flange ;
  Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Sensors.RelAngleSensor relativeAngleSensor ;
  Modelica.Blocks.Sources.Constant constant_(final k = Modelica.Constants.pi / 2) ;
  Modelica.Blocks.Math.Add add(final k2 = 1, final k1 = p) ;
  Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Interfaces.Flange_a support if useSupport "Support at which the reaction torque is acting" ;
  Modelica.Mechanics.Rotational.Components.Fixed fixed if not useSupport ;
  Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Sensors.ReferenceSensor referenceSensor(final m = m) ;
  Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Sensors.VoltageSensor voltageSensor(final m = m) ;
  Modelica.Blocks.Math.Add3 add3_1(k1 = -1) ;
  Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Blocks.ToSpacePhasor toSpacePhasor(m = m) ;
  Modelica.Electrical.Machines.SpacePhasors.Blocks.ToPolar toPolar ;
  Modelica.Blocks.Math.WrapAngle wrapAngle(final positiveRange = positiveRange) ;
equation
  connect(relativeAngleSensor.flange_b, flange) ;
  connect(relativeAngleSensor.flange_a, support) ;
  connect(relativeAngleSensor.flange_a, fixed.flange) ;
  connect(relativeAngleSensor.phi_rel, add.u1) ;
  connect(constant_.y, add.u2) ;
  connect(plug_p, referenceSensor.plug_p) ;
  connect(voltageSensor.plug_p, plug_p) ;
  connect(voltageSensor.plug_n, plug_n) ;
  connect(referenceSensor.gamma, add3_1.u2) ;
  connect(add.y, add3_1.u1) ;
  connect(toSpacePhasor.u, voltageSensor.v) ;
  connect(toSpacePhasor.y, toPolar.u) ;
  connect(toPolar.y[2], add3_1.u3) ;
  connect(add3_1.y, wrapAngle.u) ;
  connect(wrapAngle.y, rotorDisplacementAngle) ;

end RotorDisplacementAngle;

modelica://Modelica.Magnetic/ConstantMag:
Modelica.Magnetic: ConstantMagneticPotentialDifference (model)

Source of constant magnetomotive force.    See also  
