modelica://Modelica.Mechanics/PathPlanni:
Modelica.Mechanics: PathPlanning1 (model)

Given   
start and end angle of an axis maximum speed of the axis maximum acceleration of the axis  
 this component computes the fastest movement under the given constraints. This means, that:   
The axis accelerates with the maximum acceleration until the maximum speed is reached. Drives with the maximum speed as long as possible. Decelerates with the negative of the maximum acceleration until rest.  
 The acceleration, constant velocity and deceleration phase are determined in such a way that the movement starts form the start angles and ends at the end angles. The output of this block are the computed angles, angular velocities and angular acceleration and this information is stored as reference motion on the controlBus of the r3 robot.

Code:
model PathPlanning1 "Generate reference angles for fastest kinematic movement"
  extends Modelica.Blocks.Icons.Block;
  parameter Modelica.Units.NonSI.Angle_deg angleBegDeg = 0 "Start angle";
  parameter Modelica.Units.NonSI.Angle_deg angleEndDeg = 1 "End angle";
  parameter Modelica.Units.SI.AngularVelocity speedMax = 3 "Maximum axis speed";
  parameter Modelica.Units.SI.AngularAcceleration accMax = 2.5 "Maximum axis acceleration";
  parameter Modelica.Units.SI.Time startTime = 0 "Start time of movement";
  parameter Modelica.Units.SI.Time swingTime = 0.5 "Additional time after reference motion is in rest before simulation is stopped";
  final parameter Modelica.Units.SI.Angle angleBeg = Modelica.Units.Conversions.from_deg(angleBegDeg) "Start angles";
  final parameter Modelica.Units.SI.Angle angleEnd = Modelica.Units.Conversions.from_deg(angleEndDeg) "End angles";
  Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Examples.Systems.RobotR3.Utilities.ControlBus controlBus ;
  Modelica.Blocks.Sources.KinematicPTP2 path(q_end = {angleEnd}, qd_max = {speedMax}, qdd_max = {accMax}, startTime = startTime, q_begin = {angleBeg}) ;
  Modelica.Mechanics.MultiBody.Examples.Systems.RobotR3.Utilities.PathToAxisControlBus pathToAxis1(final nAxis = 1, final axisUsed = 1) ;
  Modelica.Blocks.Logical.TerminateSimulation terminateSimulation(condition = time >= path.endTime + swingTime) ;
equation
  connect(path.q, pathToAxis1.q) ;
  connect(path.qd, pathToAxis1.qd) ;
  connect(path.qdd, pathToAxis1.qdd) ;
  connect(path.moving, pathToAxis1.moving) ;
  connect(pathToAxis1.axisControlBus, controlBus.axisControlBus1) ;

end PathPlanning1;

