    input Real e[3](each final unit = "1") "Unit vector along axis of translation, resolved in frame_a (= same in frame_b)";
    input Modelica.Units.SI.Position d_guess "Select the configuration such that at initial time |d-d_guess| is minimal (d: distance between origin of frame_a and origin of frame_b)";
