          (1)  0 = d*d + d*2*e*(r_b - r_a) + (r_b - r_a)*(r_b - r_a) - L*L
       The vectors r_a, r_b and parameter L are NOT a function of
       the distance d of the prismatic joint. Therefore, (1) is a quadratic
       equation in the single unknown "d":
          (2) d*d + B*d + C = 0
