 The parameter sequence has the restriction that only values 1,2,3 can be used and that sequence[1] ≠ sequence[2] and sequence[2] ≠ sequence[3]. Often used values are:     sequence = {1,2,3} // Cardan or Tait-Bryan angle sequence = {3,1,3} // Euler angle sequence = {3,2,1}

