modelica://Modelica.Mechanics/ForceStep:
Modelica.Mechanics: ForceStep (model)

Model of a force step at time startTime. Positive force accelerates in positive direction of flange translation.

Code:
model ForceStep "Constant force, not dependent on speed"
  extends Modelica.Mechanics.Translational.Interfaces.PartialForce;
  parameter Modelica.Units.SI.Force stepForce(start = 1) "Height of force step (if negative, force is acting as load)";
  parameter Modelica.Units.SI.Force offsetForce(start = 0) "Offset of force";
