This is a connector for 1D translational mechanical systems. It has no icon definition and is only used by inheritance from flange connectors to define different icons.   
 The following variables are defined in this connector:     s: Absolute position of the flange in [m]. A positive translation means that the flange is translated along the flange axis. f: Cut-force in direction of the flange axis in [N].

