modelica://Modelica.Media/BaseProperties:
Modelica.Media: BaseProperties (model)

Code:
model extends BaseProperties(T(stateSelect = if preferredMediumStates then StateSelect.prefer else StateSelect.default), p(stateSelect = if preferredMediumStates then StateSelect.prefer else StateSelect.default)) "Base properties of medium"
  equation
    d = (1 + (p - reference_p) * kappa_const - (T - reference_T) * beta_const) * reference_d;
    h = reference_h + (T - reference_T) * cp_const + (p - reference_p) * (1 - beta_const * reference_T) / reference_d;
    u = h - p / d;
    p = state.p;
    T = state.T;
    MM = MM_const;
    R_s = Modelica.Constants.R / MM;
end BaseProperties;

