Modelica.Media: specificEnthalpy (function)

Code:
function extends specificEnthalpy "Return the specific enthalpy from the thermodynamic state"
  algorithm
    h := reference_h + (state.T - reference_T) * cp_const + (state.p - reference_p) * (1 - beta_const * reference_T) / reference_d;
end specificEnthalpy;

