modelica://Modelica.Media/velocityOfSoun:
Modelica.Media: velocityOfSound (function)

Code:
function extends velocityOfSound "Return velocity of sound from the thermodynamic state"
    extends Modelica.Icons.Function;

  algorithm
    a := sqrt(max(0, 1 / (kappa_const * Modelica.Media.Interfaces.PartialLinearFluid.density(state) - beta_const * beta_const * state.T / cp_const)));
end velocityOfSound;

modelica://Modelica.Media/isentropicExpo:
