modelica://Modelica.Media/BaseProperties:
Modelica.Media: BaseProperties (model)

This is the most simple incompressible medium model, where specific enthalpy h and specific internal energy u are only a function of temperature T and all other provided medium quantities are assumed to be constant.

Code:
model extends BaseProperties(T(stateSelect = if preferredMediumStates then StateSelect.prefer else StateSelect.default), p(stateSelect = if preferredMediumStates then StateSelect.prefer else StateSelect.default)) "Base properties of ideal gas"
  equation
    assert(T >= T_min and T <= T_max, "
Temperature T (= " + String(T) + " K) is not
in the allowed range (" + String(T_min) + " K <= T <= " + String(T_max) + " K)
required from medium model \"" + mediumName + "\".
");
    h = Modelica.Media.Interfaces.PartialSimpleIdealGasMedium.specificEnthalpy_pTX(p, T, X);
    u = h - R_s * T;
    R_s = R_gas;
    d = p / (R_s * T);
    MM = MM_const;
    state.T = T;
    state.p = p;

end BaseProperties;

