modelica://Modelica.Media/setState_dTX-7:
Modelica.Media: setState_dTX (function)

The thermodynamic state record is computed from density d, temperature T and composition X.

Code:
function setState_dTX "Return thermodynamic state as function of density d, temperature T and composition X"
  extends Modelica.Icons.Function;
  input Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.Density d "Density";
  input Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.Temperature T "Temperature";
  input Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.MassFraction X[:] = reference_X "Mass fractions";
  output Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.ThermodynamicState state "Thermodynamic state";
algorithm
  state := if size(X, 1) == nX then Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.ThermodynamicState(p = d * ({steam.R_s, dryair.R_s} * X) * T, T = T, X = X) else Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.ThermodynamicState(p = d * ({steam.R_s, dryair.R_s} * cat(1, X, {1 - sum(X)})) * T, T = T, X = cat(1, X, {1 - sum(X)}));

end setState_dTX;

