modelica://Modelica.Media/massFraction_p:
Modelica.Media: massFraction_pTphi (function)

Absolute humidity per unit mass of moist air is computed from temperature, pressure and relative humidity.

Code:
function massFraction_pTphi "Return steam mass fraction as a function of relative humidity phi and temperature T"
  extends Modelica.Icons.Function;
  input Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.AbsolutePressure p "Pressure";
  input Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.Temperature T "Temperature";
  input Real phi "Relative humidity (0 ... 1.0)";
  output Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.MassFraction X_steam "Absolute humidity, steam mass fraction";
protected
  constant Real k = 0.621964713077499 "Ratio of molar masses";
  Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.AbsolutePressure psat = Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.saturationPressure(T) "Saturation pressure";
algorithm
  X_steam := phi * k / (k * phi + p / psat - phi);

end massFraction_pTphi;

modelica://Modelica.Media/relativeHumidi:
Modelica.Media: relativeHumidity_pTX (function)

Relative humidity is computed from pressure, temperature and composition with 1.0 as the upper limit at saturation. Water mass fraction is the first entry in the composition vector.

Code:
function relativeHumidity_pTX "Return relative humidity as a function of pressure p, temperature T and composition X"
  extends Modelica.Icons.Function;
  input Modelica.Units.SI.Pressure p "Pressure";
  input Modelica.Units.SI.Temperature T "Temperature";
  input Modelica.Units.SI.MassFraction[:] X "Composition";
  output Real phi "Relative humidity";
protected
  Modelica.Units.SI.Pressure p_steam_sat "Saturation pressure";
  Modelica.Units.SI.MassFraction X_air "Dry air mass fraction";
algorithm
  p_steam_sat := min(Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.saturationPressure(T), 0.999 * p);
  X_air := 1 - X[Modelica.Media.Water];
  phi := max(0.0, min(1.0, p / p_steam_sat * X[Modelica.Media.Water] / (X[Modelica.Media.Water] + k_mair * X_air)));

end relativeHumidity_pTX;

