modelica://Modelica.Media/s_pTX:
Modelica.Media: s_pTX (function)

Specific entropy of moist air is computed from pressure, temperature and composition with X[1] as the total water mass fraction.

Code:
function s_pTX "Return specific entropy of moist air as a function of pressure p, temperature T and composition X (only valid for phi<1)"
  extends Modelica.Icons.Function;
  input Modelica.Units.SI.Pressure p "Pressure";
  input Modelica.Units.SI.Temperature T "Temperature";
  input Modelica.Units.SI.MassFraction X[:] "Mass fractions of moist air";
  output Modelica.Units.SI.SpecificEntropy s "Specific entropy at p, T, X";
protected
  Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.MoleFraction[2] Y = Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.massToMoleFractions(X, {steam.MM, dryair.MM}) "Molar fraction";
algorithm
  s := Modelica.Media.IdealGases.Common.Functions.s0_Tlow(dryair, T) * (1 - X[Modelica.Media.Water]) + Modelica.Media.IdealGases.Common.Functions.s0_Tlow(steam, T) * X[Modelica.Media.Water] - Modelica.Constants.R * (Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.Utilities.smoothMax(X[Modelica.Media.Water] / MMX[Modelica.Media.Water], 0.0, 1e-9) * Modelica.Math.log(max(Y[Modelica.Media.Water], Modelica.Constants.eps) * p / reference_p) + Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.Utilities.smoothMax((1 - X[Modelica.Media.Water]) / MMX[Modelica.Media.Air], 0.0, 1e-9) * Modelica.Math.log(max(Y[Modelica.Media.Air], Modelica.Constants.eps) * p / reference_p));

end s_pTX;

modelica://Modelica.Media/s_pTX_der:
Modelica.Media: s_pTX_der (function)

Specific entropy of moist air is computed from pressure, temperature and composition with X[1] as the total water mass fraction.

Code:
function s_pTX_der "Return specific entropy of moist air as a function of pressure p, temperature T and composition X (only valid for phi<1)"
  extends Modelica.Icons.Function;
  input Modelica.Units.SI.Pressure p "Pressure";
  input Modelica.Units.SI.Temperature T "Temperature";
  input Modelica.Units.SI.MassFraction X[:] "Mass fractions of moist air";
  input Real dp(unit = "Pa/s") "Derivative of pressure";
  input Real dT(unit = "K/s") "Derivative of temperature";
  input Real dX[nX](each unit = "1/s") "Derivative of mass fractions";
  output Real ds(unit = "J/(kg.K.s)") "Specific entropy at p, T, X";
protected
  Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.MoleFraction[2] Y = Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.massToMoleFractions(X, {steam.MM, dryair.MM}) "Molar fraction";
  Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.MolarMass MM "Molar mass";
algorithm
  MM := MMX[Modelica.Media.Water] * MMX[Modelica.Media.Air] / (X[Modelica.Media.Water] * MMX[Modelica.Media.Air] + X[Modelica.Media.Air] * MMX[Modelica.Media.Water]);
  ds := Modelica.Media.IdealGases.Common.Functions.s0_Tlow_der(dryair, T, dT) * (1 - X[Modelica.Media.Water]) + Modelica.Media.IdealGases.Common.Functions.s0_Tlow_der(steam, T, dT) * X[Modelica.Media.Water] + Modelica.Media.IdealGases.Common.Functions.s0_Tlow(dryair, T) * dX[Modelica.Media.Air] + Modelica.Media.IdealGases.Common.Functions.s0_Tlow(steam, T) * dX[Modelica.Media.Water] - Modelica.Constants.R * (1 / MMX[Modelica.Media.Water] * (Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.Utilities.smoothMax_der(X[Modelica.Media.Water], 0.0, 1e-9, dX[Modelica.Media.Water], 0.0, 0.0) * (Modelica.Math.log(max(Y[Modelica.Media.Water], Modelica.Constants.eps) * p / reference_p) + MM / MMX[Modelica.Media.Air]) + dp / p * Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.Utilities.smoothMax(X[Modelica.Media.Water], 0.0, 1e-9)) + 1 / MMX[Modelica.Media.Air] * (Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.Utilities.smoothMax_der(X[Modelica.Media.Air], 0.0, 1e-9, dX[Modelica.Media.Air], 0.0, 0.0) * (Modelica.Math.log(max(Y[Modelica.Media.Air], Modelica.Constants.eps) * p / reference_p) + MM / MMX[Modelica.Media.Water]) + dp / p * Modelica.Media.Air.MoistAir.Utilities.smoothMax(X[Modelica.Media.Air], 0.0, 1e-9)));

end s_pTX_der;

