This property is only defined in one-phase region.

Code:
function extends isobaricExpansionCoefficient "Isobaric expansion coefficient w.r.t. thermodynamic state (only valid for one-phase)"
  protected
    Modelica.Media.Common.HelmholtzDerivs f "Helmholtz derivatives";

  algorithm
    if Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.getPhase_ph(state.p, state.h) == 2 then
      beta := 0;
      // assert(getPhase_ph(state.p, state.h)==1, "Function for isobaric expansion coefficient is only valid for one-phase regime!");
    else
      f := Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.f_R134a(state.d, state.T);
