modelica://Modelica.Media/rho_ph_der-2:
Modelica.Media: rho_ph_der (function)

This function calculates the derivative of density w.r.t. time. It is used as derivative function for rho_props_ph .

Code:
function rho_ph_der "Time derivative function of density_ph"
  extends Modelica.Icons.Function;
  input Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.AbsolutePressure p "Pressure";
  input Modelica.Media.R134a.R134a_ph.SpecificEnthalpy h "Specific enthalpy";
  input Modelica.Media.R134a.Common.InverseDerivatives_rhoT derivs "Record for derivatives";
  input Real p_der "Derivative of pressure";
  input Real h_der "Derivative of specific enthalpy";
  output Real d_der "Derivative of density";
algorithm
  if derivs.phase == 2 then
    d_der := derivs.rho * (derivs.rho * derivs.cv / derivs.dpT + 1.0) / (derivs.dpT * derivs.T) * p_der + (-derivs.rho * derivs.rho / (derivs.dpT * derivs.T)) * h_der;
  else
    d_der := derivs.rho * (derivs.cv * derivs.rho + derivs.pt) / (derivs.rho * derivs.rho * derivs.pd * derivs.cv + derivs.T * derivs.pt * derivs.pt) * p_der + (-derivs.rho * derivs.rho * derivs.pt / (derivs.rho * derivs.rho * derivs.pd * derivs.cv + derivs.T * derivs.pt * derivs.pt)) * h_der;
  end if;

end rho_ph_der;

