modelica://Modelica.Thermal/TestOpenTank:
Modelica.Thermal: TestOpenTank (model)

First, the medium is pumped out of the tank (initial level = 0.5 m, T = 40°C) to an (infinite) ambient (T = 20°C):   
The level of the medium in the tank decreases. The temperature of the medium in the tank remains unchanged.  
 Subsequently the medium is pumped into the tank from an (infinite) ambient:   
The level of the medium in the tank increases again. The temperature of the medium in the tank decreases (mixing temperature).

